Automated trading, market data, and strategy backtesting

Usage:
  lazytrade [command]

Available Commands:
  account     Inspect exchange accounts
  agent       Run the trading agent
  backtest    Run strategies against historical data
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  config      Inspect and validate configuration
  data        Import and validate historical market data
  help        Help about any command
  version     Print application version

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for lazytrade

Use "lazytrade [command] --help" for more information about a command.
